<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT PARIS ST GERMAIN 6-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT PARIS ST GERMAIN 6-1.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus beat Paris SG 6-1 (halftime 4-0) in the first leg of the European soccer Supercup on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Juventus - Sergio Perrini 4, Michele Padovano 21, 40, Ciro Ferrara 34, Attilio Lombardo 82, Nicola Amoruso 89.</p>
<p>PSG - Rai penalty 52</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,519.</p>
</text>
